      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "To add to this, jaw flaps in general are broken. Visemes work fine, but every avatar I've made that just has lip flaps was not working last night. I'm not sure what a \"jaw flap blend shape\" is, but what you're experiencing may be a general effect of the jaw bone no longer being animated at all.",
