      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5c75107d0678a11a9b404cd1|full_name}: The \"jaw flap blend shape\" does not use a bone, it's basically a mesh shape key made in Blender which is then set to a simple jaw flap movement in Unity. What you might be referring to is the Jaw Flap Bone option which I haven't tried. But if jaw flaps in general are broken, it would explain why both Bone and Blend Shape are not working.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    }
